    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just... it's hard to find an anchor when you feel like you're already drifting away for good. i feel like there's no point in trying to keep up when the whole world has moved on. it's like watching a movie that ended a long time ago, but you're still sitting in the dark. it's just exhausting to keep pretending i belong here.",
